          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji kūlwa mihayo ya kwisolanhya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū bane, ū mhayo gwa kūnzunya Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, ū Seeba w'ikūjo, mutabizage nago mu kūbasolanhya a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno banhū babīlī bashikile kwingīla ng'wisinagogi ling'we; ūmò azwalile pete ya zahabu kū lwala, na shizwalo sha nyasabi; ūngī kunese, azwalile ng'wenda gūshila shilile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo azwalile shizwalo sha nyasabi ūlū ng'ūng'wīla gīkī, “Igashaga a ha soga aha ū bebe.” Lelo ū kunese ng'wene ng'ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe jaga ūkīmīīle wishishinīke aho.” Nūūlū gīkī, “Nzūgū wigashe ha sī, hihī na mhambala jane aha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ū mu gīko numho mutisolanhyaga bing'we bike, na kūbiza balamuji ba maganiko mabi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alidegelekagi badūgū batogwa, ū Mulungu atabasolile a bahabī ba mu sī gīkī babize basabi ū mu kūzunya, na babize bingīji ba mu būtemi ūbo abisagīgije abo abatogilwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we mundalahile ū ng'habī! Tūhaya a basabi hū bene abo bakamuluhyaga, na kūmudutanja kūmutwala kū mabanza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batī bene abo bakalīsondagūlaga nī lina ling'we ī lyawiza īlo mukitanīlagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūlū ng'ūshishikīlīja ī shilagīlo sha nyatemi ūmo shandīkwa shihayīlile gīkī, “Ntogagwe nzenganwa ng'wiyo gīt'ūmo witogelilwe bebe,” mukūbiza mulītūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū muyūbasolanhya a banhū, mukūbiza mulīhūba; ū mu gīko shikūmukaanīla ī shilagīlo gīkī mulī bakenaagūji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū wa kūshidima ī shilagīlo ī shose alīyo wipama mu mhayo gūmò, wabizaga nkenaagūji wa yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūyo ahayile gīkī, “Yaya ū kūshihya,” hū ng'wene ūyo ahayile nī gīkī, “Yaya ū kūbūlaga.” Nose hū kūhaya ūlū ūtī nshihani alīyo ūlī mūlagi, ū bebe ūlī nkenaagūji wa shilagīlo shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ūlū mulīyomba nūūlū mulīīta mhayo, bizagi gītī banhū abo bakūlamulwa mu nzīla ya shilagīlo sha wiyabī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno shitīho shigongo ū mu būlamulwa bokwe ūyo atachīlaga shigongo; alīyo ī shigongo shilī na nguzu kūtinda būlamulwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shītwa na kūzunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū badūgū bane, īkūbiza ho solobo kī ūlū munhū akwihayaga gīkī ū wei alī na kūzunya, alīyo atī na shītwa. Ū kūzunya kwakwe kwenūko kūdūgije kūmpīja? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wanong'wing'we ngosha nūūlū nkīma alī na makoye ga būzuuka hama alī nzala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ūmò wing'we ūng'wīla gīkī, “Jaga mhola ong'wise, ūkūlūngūja dūhū, nīyo ūkwigūta!” Ūlū mutang'winhile ī sha kwigunanhīla ū mu mīlī, īlīho solobo kī ū mu mihayo yenīyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī nū kūzunya, ūlū kūlī iyene gīko dūhū na shītwa yaya, kūkūbiza kūchile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū munhū ūngī ashikile kūkūwīla gīkī, “Ū bebe ī chene ūlī na kūzunya, ū nene nalī na shītwa;” alinoolekejage ū kūzunya kwako ūko kūtī na shītwa, nane nakoolekeje ū kūzunya kwane mu nzīla ya shītwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ūzunije gīkī ū Mulungu alī ūmò wike, ūtūngīlīgije gete; alīyo na a masamva gagūzunije ū mhayo gwenūyo, nīyo gakadetemaga na kūdetema! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe mbūūlī, hamo ūtogilwe kūmana gīkī ū kūzunya ūko kūtī na shītwa kūtī na ngofyoolo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū sīswe ū Abulahamu atabalīlilwe būtūngīlīja kūlwa nguno ya kūntūūla ha ng'walīlo ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Isaka, gīkī amfunye kūbiza shitambo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlībona gīkī ū kūzunya kwakwe kūkatūmama hamò nasho ī shītwa shakwe, nī gīkī ū kūzunya kwakwe kūkashikanyiwa mu shītwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mhayo gwenūyū shilīshikīīla ī shandīkwa īsho shihayile gīkī, “Ū Abulahamu akansanya Mulungu ūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja.” H'ūmo īkajīla nose witanwa gīkī nwani ng'wiye o ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū managi gīkī, ū munhū akabalīlagwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa shītwa, ītī mu kūzunya dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īkajīla nī mihayo ya ng'wa Lahabu, ū nkīma ūyo walī malahya. Ī gīsī nang'hwe atabalīlilwe būtūngīlīja kūlwa shītwa, īkī akabagunanha abo baalī batūng'wa, ūbafunya būja, būbītīla nzīla yīngī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gīt'ūmo mīlī gūlī, ūlū gūtī na moyo gūkabizaga gūchile; nū kūzunya h'ūmo kūlī, nako ūlū kūtī na shītwa numho kūchile!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
